  "capacity": {
   "confidence": "estimated",
   "note": "estimated - 70 cables, FS states none for the USCMH finger ducts. The channel clear cross-section, 22.3 mm high (the duct guide) by 125.56 mm deep (the well floor to the underside of the cover), divided by 39.9 mm2 a cable: the pooled ratio of the three FS ABS finger ducts whose capacity FS does state (CMH-SFD1U 48 in 1850 mm2, CMH-DFD1U 96 in 3700, CMH-SFD2U 124 in 5143). Those agree to within 8%, which is this figure's uncertainty at best; this is a different moulding. Across every FS manager the ratio runs 38.5 to 82.8 (the HD and UHD lines scale per rack unit), so it is fitted on the ABS ducts only."
  },
  "chassis": {
   "confidence": "drawing",
   "note": "drawing - THE BODY BETWEEN THE EARS. The specification table gives 44.3 x 482.2 x 162.8 mm (1.74 x 18.98 x 6.4 in) and the front view 44.3 high, 482.22 wide and the ear holes 464.47 apart across and 31.75 up; its ear folds stand 23.1 mm in from each end, so the duct is 436.3 wide, and the ears are not drawn. `depth` STATES THE VENDOR OVERALL 162.83: THE PRODUCT SELECTOR'S 5.01 in [127 mm] IS THE PROJECTION IN FRONT OF THE EARS, the 127.26 of the top view and the 5.01 in of the dimensioned render, and the table's 6.4 in and the drawing's 162.83 agree; the ribbed base stands 35.57 behind the ears."
  },
  "color": {
