  "method": {
   "confidence": "drawing",
   "note": "FIGURES FROM THE VENDOR DRAWING. The FS Horizontal Single Sided Manager datasheet (USCMH-SFDABSB1U and -B2U) has a specification table and, per model, a top view, a front view and a side view in millimetres. The model is lettered CMH-SFDABSB1U on the drawing page. Rendered at 600 dpi, the front view is 4.29 px/mm across the 482.22 and 4.63 down the 44.3, 7.7 per cent tall; its side view reads 48.5 mm up the height at the scale of its 131.61 dimension, and its top view 3.97 px/mm down the 162.83 against 4.30 across, 8 per cent short. The page is not to scale down, so heights and depths are taken from its dimensions only and widths at 4.30 px/mm. Along the depth the side view's 131.61 and 121.09 are the 127.26 of the top view plus the 4.35 the 1U side view also adds, so the cover is 10.5 deep. The top view repeats the USCMH-SFDABS1U plan, nine fingers on the same pitch, with the fingers 2.4 times as long. The renders of #317023 are the second reading."
